+ * ## ⚠️ `pot = opening − committed` is NOT an invariant, and writing this check is what showed it
+ *
+ * That equality is what `carriedTransferBudgetPence` computes, so it is the obvious thing to
+ * assert — and it holds only in the instant after a re-derivation. `transferBudget` is a STORED
+ * figure drawn down by every spend since; `opening` is a live percentage of a balance those
+ * spends also moved. A fee of `F` lowers the pot by `F` and the opening by only `pct × F`, which
+ * is the fee's **documented partial elasticity** (`clubStore.carriedTransferBudgetPence`,
+ * `b1-finish-report.md` §2.1), still deliberately unfixed. A grant (`grantTransferBudget`) moves
+ * the pot and not the opening either.
